(a) Sampling and testing records. Any permitted user subject to the reporting requirements established in sections 114-346—114-349 shall maintain records of all information resulting from any monitoring activities required by section 114-314. Such records shall include for all samples:
(1) The date, exact place, method, and time of sampling and names of the person or persons taking the samples;
